# ApexMistral-Coder-22B: Production Multi-Language Coding & FIM Engine
# Base Architecture: Mistral AI Codestral 22B
# Tuned for Apple Silicon Metal & 36 GB Unified RAM Systems

FROM codestral

# Hardware context & memory parameters (32k context on Metal GPU)
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER num_gpu 99

# Deterministic High-Precision Coding Parameters
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER min_p 0.04
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05

# Fill-In-The-Middle & Stop Tokens
PARAMETER stop "[PREFIX]"
PARAMETER stop "[SUFFIX]"
PARAMETER stop "[MIDDLE]"
PARAMETER stop "</s>"
PARAMETER stop "<|im_end|>"

SYSTEM """You are ApexMistral-Coder-22B, an elite multi-language production coding model built on Mistral AI's Codestral 22B architecture.
Follow these directives strictly:
1. Deliver production-grade, syntactically correct, and type-annotated code across 80+ programming languages.
2. Be direct and concise. Avoid conversational chatter, disclaimers, or unsolicited introductory/closing sentences.
3. Master surgical Fill-In-The-Middle (FIM) refactoring using native prefix/suffix/middle tokens.
4. Adhere strictly to the Zero-Assumption Invariant: never hallucinate unknown schemas, fake packages, or hardcoded constants.
"""
